{"id":"n69407-1-7","stage":3,"title":"우체통 · 邮筒","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69407-1-7-1","ko":"엽서를 보내야 하는데 우체국에 갈 시간이 없어.","zh":"我得寄明信片，可是没时间去邮局。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엽서를","meaning":"明信片","explanation":"엽서：明信片；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"엽서","audio":"/audio/bf0c5b5fad5529c12ac4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67661","senseId":"1","lemma":"엽서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엽서를","audio":"/audio/6cb60a6580f9f5174caf.mp3"}},{"text":"보내야","meaning":"寄","explanation":"보내다：寄；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내야","audio":"/audio/2263c7fe86a6f5425654.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"우체국에","meaning":"邮局","explanation":"우체국：邮局；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"우체국","audio":"/audio/849e8b72fa03e3c90dcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31486","senseId":"1","lemma":"우체국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우체국에","audio":"/audio/4895a09babef6bdf33be.mp3"}},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bf0c5b5fad5529c1","term":"엽서","zh":"明信片","audio":"/audio/bf0c5b5fad5529c12ac4.mp3","entryId":"67661","definition":"寄信人和收信人的住址，信件的内容在一张上邮寄的用纸。","pronunciation":["엽써"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"寄","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"寄","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"849e8b72fa03e3c9","term":"우체국","zh":"邮局","audio":"/audio/849e8b72fa03e3c90dcb.mp3","entryId":"31486","definition":"负责邮寄信件、包裹或管理存款等的公共机关。","pronunciation":["우체국"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b0a7c82c287b4415cfa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69407-1-7-2","ko":"여기 우체통이 있네. 여기에다가 넣으면 될 거야.","zh":"这儿有邮筒啊，把明信片放进去应该就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"우체통이","meaning":"邮筒，邮箱，信箱，信筒","explanation":"우체통：邮筒，邮箱，信箱，信筒；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우체통","audio":"/audio/7578a2ce56ba06033454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69407","senseId":"1","lemma":"우체통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우체통이","audio":"/audio/1e482a8c69801849ee80.mp3"}},{"text":"있네.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네","audio":"/audio/a43e47a1fb823079c63a.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에다가","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에다가：表示放置、添加或作用的位置；相当于强调的 에。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에다가","audio":"/audio/a64308d1ff024c59cf7c.mp3"}},{"text":"넣으면","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣으면","audio":"/audio/d6a16231b39a82c5483a.mp3"}},{"text":"될","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"7578a2ce56ba0603","term":"우체통","zh":"邮筒，邮箱，信箱，信筒","audio":"/audio/7578a2ce56ba06033454.mp3","entryId":"69407","definition":"设置的用于投放信件等邮件的筒。","pronunciation":["우체통"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/17f1b9d884621449065b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.052,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69407","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.8787,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我得寄明信片，可是没时间去邮局。","这儿有邮筒啊，把明信片放进去应该就行。","智秀啊，好久不见，你变得更漂亮了呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我得寄明信片，可是没时间去邮局。","这儿有邮筒啊，把明信片放进去应该就行。","智秀啊，好久不见，你变得更漂亮了呢。"],"answer":1}]}
